linux-m8x (6.6.144-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * New upstream release.
  * Custom built Linux kernel for Amlogic Meson8 / Meson8m2 TV boxes.
  * Patches 001-103 are the same series carried by 6.18-lts (001-098
    split from xdarklight's linux fork, branch
    "meson-mx-integration-6.20-20251223"; 099-103 local fixes/additions
    on top of that series), rebased onto vanilla kernel 6.6.144. See
    NOTES.txt for what needed hand-adaptation during the rebase.
  * Adds device trees for MINIX NEO X8-H, Tronsmart MXIII and M8S (dvfs).

